// BT-5083: E2E fixture for `SystemNavigation unusedSelectors`.
//
// `UnusedServerHook` overrides `Server>>handleInfo:`, which the runtime calls
// for raw Erlang messages and nothing in source sends. Only the
// `runtimeCalledSelectors` exclusion keeps the override out of the report.

Server subclass: UnusedServerHook

  handleInfo: _msg => nil
